mpared\twith\t$7.5\tbillion\tfor\t2011\tand\t$6.7\tbillion\tfor\t2010.\n\nWe\tmaintain\tthe\tallowance\tfor\tunfunded\tloan\tcommitments\tand\tletters\tof\tcredit\tat\ta\tlevel\twe\tbelieve\tis\tappropriate\tto\tabsorb\testimated\tprobable\tcredit\tlosses\ton\tthese unfunded\tcredit\tfacilities\tas\tof\tthe\tbalance\tsheet\tdate.\tSee\tNote\t1\tAccounting\tPolicies\tfor\tadditional\tinformation.\n\n# Table\t82:\tRollforward\tof\tAllowance\tfor\tUnfunded\tLoan\tCommitments\tand\tLetters\tof\tCredit\n\n| In\tmillions | 2012 | 2011 | 2010 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| January\\t1 | \\t\\t $240 | $188 | $296 |\n| Net\\tchange\\tin\\tallowance\\tfor\\tunfunded\\tloan\\tcommitments\\tand\\tletters\\tof\\tcredit | 10 | 52 | (108) |\n| December\\t31 | \\t\\t $250 | $240 | $188 |\n\n# NOTE\t8\tINVESTMENT\tSECURITIES\n\n# Table\t83:\tInvestment\tSecurities\tSummary\n\n|  | Amortized |  | Unrealized |  | Fair |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| In\\tmillions | Cost | Gains |  | Losses | Value |\n| December\\t31,\\t2012 |  |  |  |  |  |\n| SECURITIES\\tAVAILABLE\\tFOR\\tSALE |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Debt\\tsecurities |  |  |  |  |  |\n| US\\tTreasury\\tand\\tgovernment\\tagencies | \\t\\t $2,868 | \\t\\t $245 |  |  | $3,113 |\n| Residential\\tmortgage-backed |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Agency | \\t 25,844 | 952 |  | $(12) | \\t 26,784 |\n| Non-agency | 6,102 | 314 |  | (309) | 6,107 |\n| Commercial\\tmortgage-backed |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Agency | 602 | 31 |  |  | 633 |\n| Non-agency | 3,055 | 210 |  | (1) | 3,264 |\n| Asset-backed | 5,667 | 65 |  | (79) | 5,653 |\n| State\\tand\\tmunicipal | 2,197 | 111 |  | (21) | 2,287 |\n| Other\\tdebt | 2,745 | 103 |  | (4) | 2,844 |\n| Total\\tdebt\\tsecurities | \\t 49,080 | \\t 2,031 |  | (426) | \\t 50,685 |\n| Corporate\\tstocks\\tand\\tother | 367 |  |  |  | 367 |\n| Total\\tsecurities\\tavailable\\tfor\\tsale | \\t\\t $49,447 | \\t\\t $2,031 |  | $(426) | $51,052 |\n| SECURITIES\\tHELD\\tTO\\tMATURITY |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Debt\\t