ly\tfinancial\tdata\tfor\tthe\tyears\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2007\tand\t2006\tare\tas\tfollows\t(in\tmillions,\texcept\tper\tshare\tdata):\n\n# SCHEDULE\tI\n\n# (Parent\tCompany)\n\n# CONDENSED\tSTATEMENTS\tOF\tFINANCIAL\tPOSITION\n\n| (millions) | 2007 | 2006 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| ASSETS |  |  |\n| Investments\\tin\\tsubsidiaries | $6,590 | $5,925 |\n| Other\\tinvestments | 242 | 317 |\n| Notes\\treceivable\\t—\\tsubsidiaries | 235 | 40 |\n| Cash\\tand\\tcash\\tequivalents | 817 | 994 |\n| Other\\tassets | 236 | 199 |\n| Total\\tAssets | $8,120 | $7,475 |\n| LIABILITIES\\tAND\\tSTOCKHOLDERS'\\tEQUITY |  |  |\n| LIABILITIES |  |  |\n| Subordinated\\tdebt | $726 | $726 |\n| Notes\\tpayable\\t—\\tsubsidiaries | 642 | 390 |\n| 7.375%\\tlong-term\\tdebt\\tsecurities | 224 | 224 |\n| 3.5%\\tlong-term\\tdebt\\tsecurities | — | 297 |\n| 6.2%\\tlong-term\\tdebt\\tsecurities | — | 250 |\n| Accrued\\texpenses\\tand\\tother\\tliabilities | 307 | 370 |\n| Total\\tLiabilities | 1,899 | 2,257 |\n| STOCKHOLDERS'\\tEQUITY |  |  |\n| Common\\tstock | 361 | 347 |\n| Additional\\tpaid-in\\tcapital | 3,064 | 2,583 |\n| Accumulated\\tother\\tcomprehensive\\tloss | (726) | (1,010) |\n| Retained\\tearnings | 5,607 | 4,992 |\n| Less\\ttreasury\\tstock\\tat\\tcost | (2,085) | (1,694) |\n| Total\\tStockholders'\\tEquity | 6,221 | 5,218 |\n| Total\\tLiabilities\\tand\\tStockholders'\\tEquity | $8,120 | $7,475 |\n\nSee\tnotes\tto\tcondensed\tfinancial\tstatements.\n\n# (Continued)\n\n# CONDENSED\tSTATEMENTS\tOF\tINCOME\n\n| (millions) | 2007 | 2006 | 2005 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| REVENUE |  |  |  |\n| Dividends\\tfrom\\tsubsidiaries | $520 | $1,139 | $915 |\n| Other\\tinvestment\\tincome | 105 | 31 | 21 |\n| Total\\tRevenue | 625 | 1,170 | 936 |\n| EXPENSES |  |  |  |\n| Operating\\tand\\tadministrative | 12 | 4 | 12 |\n| Interest\\t—\\tsubsidiaries | 36 | 31 | 26 |\n| Interest\\t—\\tother | 86 | 104 | 111 |\n| Total\\tExpenses | 134 | 139 | 149 |\n| INCOME\\tBEFORE\\tINCOME\\